    heading: "Why NOVELA Exists"
    body: "Modern healthcare has achieved extraordinary progress, yet people still face fragmented experiences — health information scattered across systems, care journeys that are difficult to navigate, and knowledge that expands faster than it can be applied. NOVELA was created to help bridge these gaps by connecting information, intelligence, and people through thoughtfully designed technology. We envision a future where every person can navigate healthcare with greater clarity, every healthcare professional has access to better-supported intelligence, and every healthcare system benefits from technologies that strengthen collaboration rather than create more complexity."
