    heading: "Built On Responsible Intelligence"
    body: "Artificial intelligence is an important part of NOVELA, but it is not its purpose. The goal is to use AI responsibly to improve understanding, reduce unnecessary complexity, and support informed decision-making. NOVELA is designed with the belief that AI should augment human capability, not replace human judgment — with human oversight, transparency where appropriate, continuous improvement, and accountability built into its foundation."
